ttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117884.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Contributes to #43440.\n\nAdds unit tests for `AStarGrid2D`, which previously had no test coverage. The sibling class `AStar3D` has tests in `test_astar.cpp` but `AStarGrid2D` was untested.\n\n## Tests added (24 test cases, 96 assertions)\n\n**Property/configuration:** initialization defaults, region and dirty flag, cell size, offset, cell shape (with invalid value rejection), heuristic setters, jumping toggle.\n\n**Bounds and grid state:** bounds checking (including off-by-one edges), negative region offsets, operations on dirty (un-updated) grid fail gracefully, clear resets state.\n\n**Solid points and weights:** set/unset solid, fill solid region, weight scale (with negative rejection), fill weight scale region.\n\n**Position calculation:** default cell size, custom cell size with offset, `get_point_path` returns world-space positions.\n\n**Pathfinding:** simple straight-line path, path to same point, path around obstacles (verifies no solid cell in result), no path when fully blocked (empty result), partial path to closest reachable point, diagonal modes (ALWAYS vs NEVER path lengths), weight scale causing path detour.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] Build with `scons tests=yes`\n- [x] Run `bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64 --test --tc=\"*AStarGrid2D*\"` — 24 passed, 0 failed","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117884/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117884/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}